# A hosted round on the local platform, the guest's side (bob, a phone):
# Hosted Play, Quick join alice's room, then steer by the touch pad until the
# result the server script records.
# viewport 390x844@2
until 900 =Hosted Play
frames 60
touch =Hosted Play
until 300 =Quick join
frames 10
touch =Quick join
until 600 =Leave room
frames 10
save online-guest-room
until 3000 Hosted round: claim territory
frames 60
save online-guest-play
repeat 4000 until Result recorded by the StarHermit server
  touch =Move down
  frames 10
  touch =Move right
  frames 10
  touch =Move up
  frames 10
  touch =Move left
  frames 10
end
frames 30
save online-guest-results
expect Standings
